                    {
                      "code": "\t#The count as text: a text field updates as it\u0027s typed (a numeric field only on Enter or blur)\n\tif value is None: return \u0027\u0027\n\treturn (\u0027%f\u0027 % value).rstrip(\u00270\u0027).rstrip(\u0027.\u0027)",
