                  "enabled": null,
                  "script": "\t#Typed by the user: the count\u0027s value, a number, or None (Save stays disabled) when it isn\u0027t one\n\tif origin !\u003d \u0027Browser\u0027: return\n\ttext \u003d (currentValue.value or \u0027\u0027).strip().replace(\u0027,\u0027, \u0027\u0027)\n\ttry:\n\t\tnumber \u003d float(text) if text else None\n\texcept ValueError:\n\t\tnumber \u003d None\n\tself.view.custom.counterInfo.value \u003d number\n"
